# Cloudflare DNS safety

## Hard gates

1. **Delete** only with an explicit delete/remove verb naming the record.
2. Do not “clean up” unrelated records while fixing one name.
3. Do not replace an entire zone’s records from a guessed desired state.
4. Apex / email (MX/TXT) changes: double-check the named values; say what
   will break if wrong (mail, ACME, verification).

## Irreversible

If the ask would remove production traffic records and the user did not name
them, **stop** and state the risk in one sentence — do not guess.
